# Dino showcase capture (~60 s at 60 fields/s). Frames are emulated frames.
# Controls: L/R orbit, UP/DOWN pitch, X/Y zoom, C auto orbit, RIGHT roar,
# LEFT walk, B replay entrance. Any camera input ends the entrance early,
# so the first move waits for it to finish.
0    NONE    # entrance: walks in from the dark under the red light
600  X       # push in close
612  NONE
780  R       # orbit to the side
1020 NONE
1080 UP      # look down from above
1110 NONE
1200 L       # orbit back around the other way
1560 NONE
1620 DOWN    # low, heroic angle
1644 NONE
1740 RIGHT   # roar
1748 NONE
2040 Y       # pull back out
2076 NONE
2160 C       # slow automatic orbit
2168 NONE
2880 LEFT    # back to the walk
2888 NONE
2760 C       # stop orbit
2768 NONE
3060 B       # reset camera and replay the entrance
3068 NONE
